(6504, 'joh.sjo.v8o1rtivta', 'A good selection with reasonable tolerance for values greater than 5.6 volts. The lower voltage diodes where, as expected, rather poor in this regard.I was only interest in protecting MOSFETs against excessive Vgs voltage (typically +/- 20v). I only had a couple 6.2v zenners left for this purpose which I felt might show too much leakage to raise the gate resistor from 47k to less vampiric loading in my reverse polarity and overvolt protection circuits by using 1M resistors with a 12v ZD.', '2024-11-01 01:52:51', 'Positive', '155944213581', '270PCS 1/2W 2.4V-33V Zener Diode Assorted Kit 0.5W Pack UK', '5.99', '2274726072012', '2499763967005', '155944213581-2499763967005', '2024-11-04 08:57:02', NULL),
